Building executable to run this:

1) Check out the 'exodus_iga_test' branch on Roy's repository:
git@github.com:roystgnr/moose.git

2) Create a conda environment that doesn't include libmesh (called moose_nolibmesh) by doing:
mamba create --name moose_nolibmesh -q -y
mamba activate moose_nolibmesh
mamba install moose-tools moose-petsc

3) Load the conda environment that doesn't include libmesh:
mamba activate moose_nolibmesh

3) Build libmesh with HDF support (paths are for a Mac)
JOBS=28 ./scripts/update_and_rebuild_libmesh.sh --enable-hdf5 --with-hdf5=/Users/your_username/miniconda3/lib --enable-hdf5-required 

4) Build the combined module
